Description: C++ multiple-precision GMP/MPFR/MPC headers
 gmpfrxx_mkII provides C++ headers and a precision-context provider for
 multiple-precision arithmetic based on GMP, MPFR, and MPC. The provider ABI
 and final runtime/development split are still under Debian review.
